title: The Cult of the Assassin
subtitle: A public commemoration of Eligiusz Niewiadomski; PPS decides how it answers.
new-page: true
tags: pl_event
card-image: img/poster_2.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_politics_rules && PolishPolitics.cultDue(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Event society.niewiadomski_cult, B5 (technical reference 17.7, 17.4, 15.2; card catalogue 9.6): one named public
// commemoration of the assassin, only in the historical branch of the assassination of Narutowicz; three answers,
// 0 T. The existence of the cult is historical; the place, the service and its participants in this event are a
// synthetic profile of the game (TBD — historical research required). The mass is an alternative of the game.
PolishPolitics.cultView(Q);
!}

= A commemoration of the assassin

Admirers of Eligiusz Niewiadomski, who killed President Narutowicz, announce a public service in his honour. The details of this service are a synthetic event of the game, not a reconstruction of a particular commemoration. PPS must decide how its members and organisations answer. Opposing the cult of a murderer is not a position on religion or on the Church.

- @condemn
- @democracy_mass
- @stay_out

@condemn
title: Condemn the cult and order our members not to disturb the service
subtitle: 0 R; a clear instruction to the Milicja. The Centrum approves under the line of parliamentarism; the Christian Democrats join the condemnation only if they are close enough to us.
choose-if: {! return PolishPolitics.cultStatus(Q, 'condemn').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_b5_condemn_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishPolitics.cultChoose(Q, 'condemn');
!}
go-to: result

@democracy_mass
title: Organise a mass for the defence of democracy
subtitle: 1 R, if a clergyman and a host agree; a campaign on the defence of democracy and, once held, democracy +2. No alliance with the Christian Democrats and no change of our programme on the Church.
choose-if: {! return PolishPolitics.cultStatus(Q, 'democracy_mass').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_b5_democracy_mass_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishPolitics.cultChoose(Q, 'democracy_mass');
!}
go-to: result

@stay_out
title: Do not engage our organisations
subtitle: 0 R; no campaign and no cost. The Left objects only if a public answer had been promised.
choose-if: {! return PolishPolitics.cultStatus(Q, 'stay_out').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_b5_stay_out_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishPolitics.cultChoose(Q, 'stay_out');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= A commemoration of the assassin

[+ pl_b5_result +]

- @root: Continue.
